From 70463bdb7ec9827ce248b0718044396d3aa042cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:20:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] metrics: block validation stages, script checks, caches,
 UTXO, reorgs

Only the total time to connect a block was exported. Where that time
goes, how well the validation caches and the UTXO cache work, how often
the cache is flushed, and how often the chain reorganizes or refuses
blocks, needed -debug=bench logs or nothing.

- fullnode_block_validation_stage_seconds{stage}: the -debug=bench stage
  timers, now also recorded: check, forks, connect, verify (only the
  script wait; the bench log's verify includes connect), index
  (ConnectBlock), and load, flush, chainstate, post_connect (ConnectTip).
  Recorded once a block is connected: failed blocks and template checks
  (fJustCheck) are not counted. Buckets 10 us to 60 s.
- fullnode_script_check_transactions and fullnode_script_check_workers:
  per block, the transactions whose scripts had to be checked and the
  workers used. This tier checks a block's scripts on
  ParallelScriptWorkerPool (one worker per pending transaction, up to the
  hardware threads), not on the CCheckQueue (-par), which ConnectBlock
  no longer feeds; so "queue depth and parallelism" are measured there,
  per block, rather than as an instantaneous queue length that would read
  0 at almost every scrape.
- fullnode_validation_cache_lookups_total{cache=signature|
  script_execution,result=hit|miss}: SignatureCache::Get (both cache
  levels) and the script execution cache lookups of ConnectBlock and
  CheckInputScripts.
- fullnode_utxo_cache_bytes and fullnode_utxo_cache_entries, set in
  FlushStateToDisk from the values it already computes (active
  chainstate only), and fullnode_utxo_cache_flush_seconds{mode=flush|
  sync} around the coins flush (_count counts flushes).
- fullnode_utxo_cache_lookups_total{result=hit|miss|absent}: FetchCoin of
  the chainstate's cache (CoinsTip). coins.cpp is in the common library,
  which does not link the node's metrics, so CCoinsViewCache takes an
  optional counter pointer, set by CoinsViews::InitCache with -metrics.
  Other caches (the per-block connect view, mempool views, tools) count
  nothing.
- fullnode_chain_reorgs_total and fullnode_chain_reorg_depth_blocks
  (histogram, 1 to 1000), in ActivateBestChainStep when it disconnected
  blocks.
- fullnode_blocks_invalid_total{source=validation|invalidateblock} and
  fullnode_blocks_parked_total{reason=policy|finalization_conflict|
  deep_reorg|requested}, at each place a block is marked failed or
  parked.

Cardinality: stage histogram 9 label sets, script check histograms 1
each, cache lookups 4, utxo gauges 1+1, utxo lookups 3, flush histogram
2, reorgs 1, reorg depth 1, invalid 2, parked 4.

Hot paths: FetchCoin (per input) adds a null-pointer test, and with
-metrics a sharded relaxed counter add; SignatureCache::Get and the
script cache lookups add GetNodeMetrics (one acquire load) and, with
-metrics, one counter add; each connected block adds nine ring pushes.
No lock is added. Measured with the benches at the end of the series.

Evidence:
- metrics_tests (new: UTXO cache lookups counted hit/miss/absent only on
  the cache given the counter; stage and park labels), coins_tests,
  sigcache_tests, validation_tests, txvalidationcache_tests,
  checkqueue_tests pass; all targets build (common-library users
  included).
- interface_metrics_validation.py: 110 blocks time each of the nine
  stages 110 times; UTXO cache gauges positive; a submitted block with a
  mempool transaction and an unseen one records a script check queue
  depth and workers, a signature cache miss and script execution cache
  hit and miss; gettxoutsetinfo flushes (mode=flush), after which a
  lookup misses and a nonexistent outpoint is absent; an
  invalidate/mine/reconsider sequence makes one reorg of depth 1 and
  counts invalidateblock; a block paying too much counts as invalid by
  validation; parkblock counts as requested.

Not tested: policy, finalization-conflict and deep-reorg parks; sync
flushes; signature cache hits.

Coordinator integration provenance (reference405):
Preserve earlier purposeful source repairs through downstream consumer/context adaptations; exact conflict ledger retained.
All60 authored input payloads retained, with prerequisite-aware same-purpose splits; distinct legacy-index and inherited CXX compatibility remain independent. Pre-format source equals exact403+all60 control tree95718fceff83364b74294a751bd752b2f1a4e384. Only pinnedRuff import/format cleanup follows. Original author commands/hashes are historical reference evidence, not combined405 approval. Reference OFF/native/Rust full gates are preserved separately; combined compile/runtime NOT_RUN.

